== About

I am an Assistant Professor at the [https://sse.cuhk.edu.cn/en School of Science and Engineering], [https://www.cuhk.edu.cn/en The Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen] (CUHK-Shenzhen).
Previously, I received my Ph.D. in Computer Science and Engineering from CUHK in 2025, supervised by [http://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/~byu/ Prof. Bei Yu].
I received my B.Eng. from [https://www.zju.edu.cn/english/ Zhejiang University (ZJU)] in 2021.
My research interests include 3D Integrated Circuits, VLSI CAD, Machine Learning in EDA, and GPU Acceleration.

I am seeking motivated M.Phil./Ph.D. students and Research Assistants with backgrounds in electronic engineering, computer science and engineering, applied mathematics, or related fields. If you are interested, please feel free to contact me by email.

